## Weigh yourself every day

Weigh yourself each morning after going to the toilet and before breakfast. Contact your team if you gain **2kg (about 4 pounds) in 3 days**, or as your plan says.

## Salt and fluids

- eat less **salt**
- follow any advice about how much to drink. Some people are asked to limit fluids

## Stay active

Regular, gentle exercise helps. Cardiac rehabilitation will help you build up safely.

## Look after yourself

- have the **flu**, **COVID-19** and **pneumonia** vaccines
- stop smoking and cut down on alcohol
- check with a pharmacist before taking new medicines. Some, such as ibuprofen, can make heart failure worse

## Your feelings

Anxiety and low mood are common. Talk to your team, your GP or a support group.

## Support

The **British Heart Foundation** and the **Pumping Marvellous Foundation** support people with heart failure.
